    axes: { harm: -1, pitch: 1, ornament: 0, meter: 1, density: 0, transmission: 0, improv: 0, soundTech: -2, intensity: 0, voice: 2, timbre: 1, percussion: 1, cyclicity: 2 },
    description: 'Early-20th-century Brazilian syncretic Afro-spiritualist tradition combining candomblé, indigenous, and Kardecist-spiritualist elements; pontos cantados (sung points) for spirit-line invocation, atabaque-drum-and-vocal architecture.',
    exemplars: ['Continental Records umbanda hino series (1960s-70s)', 'Caboclo Sete Flechas — pontos cantados archive', 'Coral de Umbanda do Rio de Janeiro', 'Pontos cantados field recordings'],
    status: 'documented',
