    description: 'Late-2010s house subgenre characterized by deep-pulsing bass-and-kick "slap" sound and atmospheric synth pad-and-vocal-chop arrangement. Originated through Brazilian producer Vintage Culture and the broader Onerpm and Brazilian house scene; rapidly spread globally through TikTok and Spotify viral mainstream-electronic circulation 2019-2022. Distinguished by the "slap" bass-and-kick processing technique as the defining sonic signature.',
