    description: '2010s deep-and-progressive-house subgenre emphasizing melodic-and-harmonic-development over rhythmic-and-functional dance-floor utility. The Anjunadeep label (founded 2005 as Anjunabeats deep-house sublabel, ran by Above & Beyond) consolidated the canonical melodic house roster. Yotto, Lane 8, Eli & Fur, Jody Wisternoff, and the broader Anjunadeep-Mango Alley-Last Night On Earth label network extended the genre into ambient-leaning deep-house adjacency.',
