    exemplars: ['Bismillah Khan — canonical shehnai wedding-baraat master', '"Aaj Mere Yaar Ki Shaadi Hai" (Aadmi Sadak Ka 1977 film-baraat canonical)', '"Dulhe Ka Sehra" (Dhadkan 2000 film-baraat)', 'Punjabi baraat-bhangra hybrid wedding-procession music', 'Traditional shehnai-and-dholak baraat repertoire'],
