    exemplars: ['Tanya Tagaq — modern Inuit-throat-singing canonical', 'Madeleine Allakariallak — traditional Inuit katajjaq canonical', 'Sila — Inuit katajjaq women-duo canonical', 'PIQSIQ canonical Inuit-throat-singing modern recording', 'Modern Inuit katajjaq-revival continuous-living tradition'],
